# HEADER
[0x0] Type
[0x1] Bit mask {
    [0x01] Timeout card
    [0x02] Boss Invincible
    [0x04] Has Dialog Before
    [0x08] Use Update Script
    [0x10] Use Create Script
}
[0x2] Length
[0x3] Difficulty
[0x4] Max Score / Dialogs count
[0x5] Good Drop
[0x6] Bad Drop
[0x7] SpellCard Index
[0x8] SpellCard Practice group
# STRUCTURE
ID
HEADER
SPELLCARD_NAME
BOSS_NAME
BACKGROUND
DIALOGS
UPDATE_SCRIPT
CREATE_SCRIPT